      "message": "test(xtask): add the gcode crate to the reach and prebuild fixtures\n\nMain's newer xtask tests list the workspace crates by hand. The edge\ncamcraft-gcode -> camcraft-geometry puts gcode in the reach of geometry,\nand the batch prebuild fixture needs a stub crates/gcode member.\nCargo.lock takes the workspace version 0.25.0 for camcraft-gcode.\n\nRefs #2217\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
