      "message": "test(gcode): gate maps and a degenerate-input suite\n\nBoth gcode suites name their modules in a Gate map line, so quick selects\nthem for a change of any crates/gcode/src module. degenerate_input checks\nthat malformed programs give a value or a refusal, never a panic or hang.\nThe decision file records the merge onto current main.\n\nFixes #2217\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
